  "title": "Valencian Collaboration Space (Spain): towards multi-level governance in support of the EU Missions",
  "summary": "A robust multi-level governance framework is necessary to coordinate actions, foster synergies, and lead the collaborative implementation of EU Missions. The Valencian Collaboration space utilises existing m ulti-level networks and collaborative mechanisms that are essential for achieving effective multi-level governance. These elements offer support to local governments in the design and implementation of local adaptation strategies and actions. The case study delves into the ongoing development of a multi-level governance framework in València, Spain.",
